      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "11. Keeping in mind the evidence given by the petitioner it becomes just and necessary to look into whether the orders required by the petitioner various reliefs which are fallen U/sec. 18, 19, 20 and 22 of DV Act can be granted."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f33dec8d1e89426a84cce39c2d65e354_60",
      "summary_section": "issue",
      "labels": [
        "ISSUE"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "14. The points that arise for consideration are:-"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8c5bbb307af04d0598b761c87cd9cd7f_61",
      "summary_section": "issue",
      "labels": [
        "ISSUE"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n 1. Whether the petitioner is entitled for  the Protection Orders as contemplated  under Sec.18 of DV Act?\n 2.Whether the petitioner is entitled for Jayalakshmi."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f39c18d14c1447a2b104ad396b41b1b6_64",
      "summary_section": "issue",
      "labels": [
        "ISSUE"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n 3. Whether the petitioner is entitled for  monetary relief as contemplated under Sec.20 of DV Act?"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3fc4366430334b5493e0107a6bca995d_65",
      "summary_section": "issue",
      "labels": [
        "ISSUE"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n 4. Whether the petitioner is entitled for  compensation relief as contemplated  under Sec.22 of DV Act?\n 5. What order?\n "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8ed0d41476934885a2f030fa9d316abd_66",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "15. The findings to the above points are as follows:-\n Point Nos.1 to 4: In the Negative  Point No.5: As per Final Order, for the  following:-\n R EAS O N S  16. Reasoning on Point No.1 to 4: Since these points are interconnected with each o"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9764954b3b184e0abc7cd52c6fc8b4aa_67",
      "summary_section": "issue",
      "labels": [
        "ISSUE"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The case of the petitioner is that the respondent has given mental and physical harassment by neglecting the petitioner and her daughter."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "14a45ce764c04536949c75cd85c49a7c_68",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n 18. As per the provisions of Sec.18 of DV Act."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "40cb9595bc1b4f1e85832d9638a2a279_69",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per this section, the Magistrate may, after giving the petitioner and the respondent an opportunity of being heard and on being prima-facie satisfied that domestic violence has taken place or is likely to take place, pass a protection or"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e9b63feda8964287a3a560e98d81e670_72",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In the affidavit filed by the petitioner along with petition she has stated that the averments made in the petition are all true and correct."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "643408ea8e764adba36bb2fe8ff129bd_73",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The petitioner has stated that she was subjected to verbal, physical, mental and emotional abuse and she was also subjected to economic violence by not providing money for maintaining herself and  9  C.Misc. 20/2023 her daughter and the res"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e8ebfdca7167489681bc65297f604fbb_75",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n 20 . Further on perusal of the petition, the main contention of the petitioner the respondent harassed her and her daughter mentally and physically by not providing basic necessities to them."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "20795d6accf74159813a9ce691445d7e_76",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Further, the respondent had given good education to their children who were born through one Sudha."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3716191e15a941d7b4b6b69ae32835d9_77",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "But, the respondent has not given proper education to the daughter of the petitioner namely Meenakshi."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "99211b5010bc47528c37d1482a115853_78",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nThereafter, the respondent always avoided the petitioner mentally and physically."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "62c0442f3dc74c75a1fca5d58344546b_79",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "For this reason, the petitioner herself has left the matrimonial home in the year December 2007."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3420c3b27ee94901a971a251f70258f8_81",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "H B on 30 January, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/114123177/\n7  C.Misc. 20/2023 regarding domestic violence caused by the respondent towards her and her daughter."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "81a502c8bb484748984650f40f170983_82",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "On the other hand, after issuance of notice, the said notice was served on respondent, but he has not received the same and he was not appeared before court."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "484e7f5b21714ba889c728ddafd1608e_83",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence he placed ex-parte.\n 21."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a23d70b7295047a88e0a0afbba836664_84",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "No doubt, as per Sec.3 of DV Act, if at all the respondent commits any domestic violence as above pleaded is fully established by the petitioner"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8276392a77b84378a72dc096bc73c205_85",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "then definitely the petitioner will be entitled for an order of protection under Sec.18 and for residential orders as per Sec.18 of DV Act and mandatory reliefs as contemplated under Sec.20 of the Act."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f9591e58e34947e2a924c5694c19bc17_86",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n 22 . In the case on hand, it is the case of the petitioner that she is residing along with the respondent after the marriage in the shared house, wherein the respondent has given mental and physical torture by not providing basic necessit"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "aaeffcc922234e278b475f23501d7408_87",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Here the petitioner has prayed relief of alternative accommodation."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "77dfc80c57304900ba2b1966d856ca8f_88",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In this case, the petitioner has not proved the allegations made  11  C.Misc. 20/2023 by her in her petition by aducing oral and documentary evidence."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a62b2aaafc614346bd3aef92ab3662e0_89",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, there is no necessity to discuss regarding sec. 19 of PWDV Act.\n 23."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "74ef7a43f08f41acbfff1fa9837c5d1a_90",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "With regard to the reliefs as contemplated under Jayalakshmi."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "09d5386910974cd896329caa1db6a4f3_92",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "H B on 30 January, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/114123177/\n8 Sec.18 i.e, the protection orders as well as regarding the possession of mandatory reliefs as contemplated under Sec.20, it becomes just and necessary for the "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "43fa70cf782e430b9226569f655ee0db_93",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n 24. The fact that both petitioner and the respondent are wife and husband is not in dispute."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e1997f9e7c3c4da086cf2df8abaf390e_94",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "When the petitioner has let in evidence she has stated that subsequent to marriage, she was residing with the respondent in the shared household."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "28cabe8d5d234373b5d0288a0b215ea0_95",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "After the death of her son, the respondent totally neglected the petitioner and her daughter."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "21218e18d20343f480920f59d8b29d41_96",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Herein, expect oral allegations the petitioner has not furnished any documents to show that the respondent has caused domestic violence against the petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "13d8d062f87b4373b088a756240ea122_98",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Further, on perusal of the pleadings as well as chief affidavit of PW.1, it is clear that the respondent has not caused domestic violence against the petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "323e1cc63bbb4188805280f9304de82a_99",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n 26. On the other hand, after service of notice, the respondent has not appeared before the court and he placed ex-parte."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "dfc8649f83224c0390f0ebc75f67645d_100",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n 27. The petitioner examined herself as PW-1 by filing Jayalakshmi."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ec372c69680841cd8cdfde7d08c2d8dc_103",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In the said examination-in- chief, she reiterated the averments of the petition."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1295f85afed04b7eb5be842095ac6098_104",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The respondent had not appeared before the court and he is placed ex-parte."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1b0da2ac3d3e42cb8e86992f074bacb8_105",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, the cross of PW.1 is taken as nil and also the evidence of the respondent is taken as nil."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "425577dde16c45c99ae5d1cf2b325cb7_107",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nOn perusal of the materials produced on record, the both parties have not obtained divorce from competent court of law."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "311b9ef398144f40b415e67196b0feeb_108",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Further, the petitioner has not proved her case therefore,\n 13  C.Misc. 20/2023 the reliefs sought by the petitioner in her petition are cannot be considered."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3dd1c77f6ddd4e108a0bf655d8e0116f_109",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n 29 . Further, the petitioner is failed to prove the allegations which are made by her in the petition as well as in examination in chief of PW1 in respect of domestic violence caused by the respondent as per Sec. 3 of PWDV Act."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a3f7827e3d034686be90268814541545_110",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n 30 . The Section 3 in The Protection of Women from Domestic Violence Act, 2005 reads as under;\nSec. 3. Definition of domestic violence.--\n For the purposes of this Act, any act, omission or  commission or conduct of the respondent shall  "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "eae4150cfa904493be6d60f8e3719e03_112",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "H B on 30 January, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/114123177/\n10  (b) harasses, harms, injures or endangers the  aggrieved person with a view to coerce her or any  other person related to her to meet any unlawful  demand fo"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b2d1eef128ce4d0cbeed68b259376459_113",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": " (c) has the effect of threatening the aggrieved  14  C.Misc. 20/2023  person or any person related to her by any  conduct mentioned in clause (a) or clause (b); or  (d) otherwise injures or causes harm, whether  physical or mental, to the "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "809377f5e84b4ed18ec0df04347131ce_114",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "On discussing above, if the respondent has not committed any domestic violence against the petitioner, as contemplated u/sec. 3 of PWDV Act, the petitioner is not entitled for any reliefs as prayed by her in her petition."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "adbbd3b670a3487ca8b763fe0d219ff3_115",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nHence, this court answer these point nos.1 to 4 in the the negative."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "754bdee8470f493e83196ec8d1442496_117",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In view of the findings on the above point nos.1 to 4 and the reasons stated therein, this court proceed to pass the following: -\n ORDER"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d94bacc9c4f744cb915f84e1e6355d0c_118",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The petition filed by the petitioner U/sec. 12 of the Protection of Women C.Misc. 20/2023 from Domestic Violence Act, 2005 is hereby dismissed."
    }
  ],
